xinput-plus (6.6.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #NNNNNNN)
  * debian/control: drop the redundant source Priority field; bump
    Standards-Version to 4.7.4; add Multi-Arch: foreign; fix
    Build-Depends by replacing qt6-tools-dev-tools with qt6-l10n-tools
    (the package that actually ships the Qt 6 lrelease); depend on
    qt6-svg-plugins for SVG icon rendering instead of libqt6svg6.
  * debian/rules: add override_dh_auto_clean; fail the build when no
    lrelease is available instead of silently shipping without
    translations.
  * debian/copyright: add an explicit GPL-3+ stanza for the self-designed
    application icon src/xinput-plus.svg.
  * Add debian/upstream/metadata and an autopkgtest smoke test
    (debian/tests/).
  * debian/xinput-plus.metainfo.xml: use the io.github.wachin.xinput-plus
    component id; add a description to every <release>.
  * debian/xinput-plus.desktop: add StartupWMClass.
  * debian/xinput-plus.1: add AUTHORS and BUGS sections.
  * xinput-plus.py: switch to the /usr/bin/python3 shebang and honor
    XDG_CONFIG_HOME.

